{"id":3436,"date":"2020-12-02T16:43:08","date_gmt":"2020-12-02T16:43:08","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/?page_id=3436"},"modified":"2021-11-22T14:44:45","modified_gmt":"2021-11-22T14:44:45","slug":"call-for-papers","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/workshops\/leiden2022\/call-for-papers\/","title":{"rendered":"Call for Papers"},"content":{"rendered":"<h1>SWAT4HCLS 2021\/2 CfP<\/h1>\n<p>We invite submissions for the 2022 edition. Topics of interest include, but are not limited to the following:<\/p>\n<p><b>Semantic Web Infrastructures and Resources in Healthcare and Life Science<\/b><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Architectures and algorithms to support volume and scale, rapid knowledge changes and heterogeneity<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Semantic querying, data validation languages, knowledge graphs, rule-based systems.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Infrastructures supporting provenance, traceability, trust and reproducibility<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Information visualization and exploratory analysis methods<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Biomedical ontologies, rules and medical standards for interoperability<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Semantic workflow technologies and semantic web services applied in life sciences.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Semantic Web technologies in FAIR data and open data ecosystems7<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Semantic scientific publishing in the life sciences, medicine and healthcare, public health<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Semantic infrastructures for patient-centric healthcare data ecosystems<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><b>Semantic Web and AI in Healthcare and the Life Sciences<\/b><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Explainable AI and semantics<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Ontology based neural symbolic reasoning and learning<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Machine learning and data mining methods for Semantic Web data<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Knowledge-driven ML and data mining<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">NLP and text mining using semantic technologies<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Clinical Intelligence from Electronic Health Records (EHRs), patient data and clinical trial data<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><b>Semantic Web Technologies across Healthcare and Life Science Communities<\/b><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Semantic Web and biodiversity<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Semantic Web agriculture, food and nutrition<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Semantic Web drug discovery and drug repurposing<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Semantic Web translational medicine and personalized medicine<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Semantic Web and bioimaging<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Semantic Web and SARS-COV2<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Important Dates:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Abstract submission open: <strong>August 1st 2021<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Full paper submission:<del> <\/del><strong>S<del>eptember 30th 2021\u00a0<\/del> October 14 2021<\/strong><del><strong><br \/>\n<\/strong><\/del><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Posters and demo submissions: <del><strong>October 8th 2021 <\/strong><\/del><strong>October 14 2021<\/strong><del><strong><br \/>\n<\/strong><\/del><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Notification of acceptance: <strong><del>November 15th<\/del>\u00a0November 22 2021<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Conference Dates:<\/b><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Monday, January 10th 2022: Tutorials<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Tuesday, January 11th and Wednesday, January 12th\u00a0 2022: Main Conference<br \/>\n<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Thursday, January 13th 2022: Hackathon<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Types of submission<\/b><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The following types of submissions for SWAT4HCLS 2022 are invited:<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Long papers:\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Research papers \u2013 Original research on a topic of interest to the SWAT4HCLS audience.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">In-use papers \u2013 New applications and tool descriptions addressing a topic of interest to the SWAT4HCLS audience.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Short papers:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Position papers, application notes, discovery notes, using Semantic Web applications and tools.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Instructions for Authors<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>All submissions will be handled via the EasyChair submission system at <a href=\"https:\/\/easychair.org\/conferences\/?conf=swat4hcls\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https:\/\/easychair.org\/conferences\/?conf=swat4hcls<\/a><\/li>\n<li>All papers and posters must be in English and submitted in pdf using the LNCS format <a href=\"http:\/\/www.springer.de\/comp\/lncs\/authors.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http:\/\/www.springer.de\/comp\/lncs\/authors.html<\/a><\/li>\n<li>Submissions for long papers must be a maximum of ten pages.<\/li>\n<li>Submissions for short papers must be a maximum of five pages.<\/li>\n<li>Submissions for posters abstract must be a maximum of two pages.<\/li>\n<li>Papers will be peer-reviewed by at least three members of the Scientific Program Committee.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>SWAT4HCLS 2021\/2 CfP We invite submissions for the 2022 edition. Topics of interest include, but are not limited to the following: Semantic Web Infrastructures and Resources in Healthcare and Life Science Architectures and algorithms to support volume and scale, rapid &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/workshops\/leiden2022\/call-for-papers\/\">Continue reading <span class=\"meta-nav\">&rarr;<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":3529,"parent":3430,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-3436","page","type-page","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/3436","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=3436"}],"version-history":[{"count":10,"href":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/3436\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":3533,"href":"https: